{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"37":"The Book of Fighting [The Prohibition of Bloodshed]"},"section_detail":{"37":{"hadithnumber_first":3966,"hadithnumber_last":4132,"arabicnumber_first":3966,"arabicnumber_last":4132,"name_native":"كتاب القتال [تحريم الدماء]"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4113,"arabicnumber":4113,"text":"اخبرنا محمد بن العلاء، عن ابي معاوية، عن الاعمش، عن شقيق، عن عبد الله، قال قتال المومن كفر وسبابه فسوق","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Muquf"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Muquf"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":37,"hadith":148}}]}